rows.en:
I swung the knife around wildly.
"Gah!"
Someone screamed.{p}

"Why are you trying to kill me?!"
I asked.
I couldn't think of anything I'd done to make someone I'd just met hate me that much.{p}

With a ripping slash, my back was cut open.
Damn it!
There was another one hiding...{p}

"Once you're dead, I get to keep your body. That's the deal.
I'll take such good care of it... Heh heh."
As my consciousness faded, an image of Iwashita hugging my corpse flickered up and vanished.{p}

But Iwashita just grinned.
"You can't kill me. Because I'm in love with you."
...What the hell is she talking about★{p}

When I tried to open the door, I realized it was locked.
That's right, I have to find the keys.
Without the keys, I can't get in anywhere.{p}

Hino licked the bloody knife with a flick of his tongue.
"When you keep on killing, you gradually start to feel like a god.
So just imagine their faces when they're forced to realize they were nothing but worthless people after all."{p}

Hino grinned.
"Huh, that's a sudden change of attitude. Are you plotting something?"
"N-no, I'm not. I just can't take any more. I'll do anything, so please forgive me."{p}

"Looks like you mean it. Get up."
Hino pulled me to my feet.
"In that case, I'll accept you as a fellow member of the Murder Club. Drink this."{p}
